WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
1. Choose stages and guardrails
Set the rollout stages and the health conditions required to move between them.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
2. Start with limited exposure
Give v2 a small share of traffic. Observe errors and latency before allowing another increase.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
3. Let checks decide
In this example the checks pass, so the controller expands to 25%. A failed check would pause or roll back instead.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
4. Complete a healthy rollout
Continue through the approved stages until v2 serves everyone. Keep monitoring after promotion.
